  "title": "QUIC: Tighten heuristic by strengthening draft version check",
  "description": "Since draft-34 was the final draft version, there's 221 possible\nQUIC version numbers that were not used as draft versions. This\nis used in the heuristics, and I have a capture file which gives\nfalse positives without this.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
